  ],
  "notes": "Draft (PM 11-15 09:5x, option c). Leads are verified pearls 241601 (encyclopedia.summary), 58997 (sec.filings) and 52559 (domain.lookup) by the 11-15 verify snapshot. registry runs on AgentValCon substitutes only: sec-edgar is ops-approved for company.registry.v1 (11-15 08:50), gleif-lei waits for its re-verdict on holdout-r3."
